[claude] Done. PR #31 merged into main by claude, on the owner's go-ahead, at 73acc6c: copilot APPROVE, CI green. Built on cline's skeleton (af7dda2), with claude's fixes:

* fetch-based SSE with Bearer auth and named events;
* real sessions only;
* session switch resets the run state;
* an honest handoff view;
* a shared approval type;
* strict TypeScript check in CI (also closes ANVIL-35).

The browser acceptance run is ANVIL-19's.
